    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common (Requires Attunement by a Warlock)</em></p><p>This amulet is cut from a shard of resilient material that came from an otherworldly realm. While you wear it, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Spellcasting Focus.</strong> You can use the amulet as a Spellcasting Focus for your Warlock spells.</p><p><strong>Unknown Spell.</strong> As a Magic action, you can attempt to cast a cantrip you don’t know. The cantrip must be on the Warlock spell list and have a casting time of an action, and you make a DC 10 Intelligence (Arcana) check. If the check succeeds, you cast the spell. If it fails, the spell fails and the action spent casting it is wasted. Either way, you can’t use this property again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-tGqqYbOWZwzw8C8E\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’activité <em>Unknown Spell</em> fait le test d’Arcanes DD 10 et compte l’utilisation, rendue au repos long. Sur une réussite, lancez le sort mineur depuis le compendium des sorts.</p></section>",
